{title: Sweet Victory}
{artist: Larry Holder / Elton Smith}
{time: 4/4}
{key: D}
{tempo: 112}

>Lyrics

Introduction

Verse 1

I am free from the guilt of my sin

Now the Lord has full control.

I'm a child of the King through eternity

With the seal of His Spirit on my soul!

Singing...

Chorus

Victory, sweet victory!

By Your grace I am whole

As Your grace covers me.

From these chains You set me free

Set me free with Your love

In a sweet victory!

Verse 2

Through the cross, I'm united with Christ

To the Lord I now belong.

Nothing in this world can tear me away from Him

I rejoice, as I praise Him with this song!

Singing...

(Repeat Chorus)

Victory, sweet victory!

By Your grace I am whole

As Your grace covers me.

From these chains You set me free

Set me free with Your love

In a sweet victory!

Set me free with Your love

In a sweet victory!

Set me free with Your love

In a sweet victory!

Ending

Victory, sweet victory!

Victory, sweet victory!

Victory, sweet victory!

Victory, sweet victory!

Victory, sweet victory!

Victory, sweet victory!
